# Sethos Nahida Fischl Dehya. Sethos Quickburn. Sethos looses a Shadowpeircing shot at the start of the chamber and end of his field time. Deyha uses Sacgs to fit he rotation length and is skipped if she isn't ready. Nahida fills time when SacGS fails to proc. Scroll > Deepwood Deyha.

# Team- Options listed by DPS
sethos char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
